  "use_case": "Use this new patient registration authorization decision when staff must document demographics source and contact. Reconcile representative authority, privacy acknowledgment, chart match, and visit handoff before the new patient registration handoff. Use registration source documents, demographic confirmation, representative authority, privacy notice receipt, duplicate-record result, communication preference, and check-in handoff. This registration centers chart creation, demographic confirmation, representative authority, communication preference, privacy receipt, duplicate-record prevention, guarantor routing, and front-desk arrival. Ask the assigned new patient registration reviewer to confirm demographics source against the organization's policy.",
